I hoped to ease her fears while shutting away both my\nleftover pride, as well as the impulse to cry deep within\nmy heart.%K%P
仅仅是编织出让她安心的话语，\n我那想哭的心情、伴随着自豪，被紧紧地锁在了内心深处。%K%P
