Even as a puddle of water gathered below us, I could feel\nMitoko's warmth through the wet fabric of my clothes.%K%P
榻榻米上已经湿到了快要形成水坑的地步，\n隔着很重的吸了水的衣服，\n美都子的温暖传了过来。%K%P
