But compared to the Mitoko I'd come to know these past few\nmonths, that was a far more fitting reaction for a girl\nher age.%K%P
但是，这是比起我所知道的美都子、\n更为和年龄相衬的样子。%K%P
The fact that she was acting like a young girl who needed\nsomeone to look after her caused my once-extinguished\npride to ge reignited.%K%P
唤起了已经燃尽的我的自尊的，\n『应该守护的她』，这种应有的样子。%K%P
