%LC理
\dIt's summer, so it shouldn't be too bad. You're not cold,\nare you?\d%K%P
「毕竟是夏天…没有问题的吧？\n很暖和的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
Her originally dry hair had gotten all wet from the drops\nof rain falling from my face, but it was still alluringly\nsoft to the touch.%K%P
本应该是干的头发，\n被从我身上滴下来的水珠沾湿了，\n但我还是用手指梳着，让其流下。%K%P
I couldn't resist stroking it, which caused Mitoko's body\nto relax as she happily leaned even closer against me.%K%P
美都子就这样被抚摸着头发，\n仿佛十分开心地放松了身体的力量，\n不断地增加着靠在我身上的体重。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I was her guardian.%K%P
因为是监护人。%K%P
I rationalized it to myself... It was only natural that an\nadult would comfort a child this way.%K%P
我，是她的监护人。\n是可以对她付诸骨肉之情的，\n是有必要这么做的，毕竟我是大人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...It's not stopping.\d%K%P
「…没有停呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMhm.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut don't you think the wind has grown a bit weaker? I\nimagine it will completely die down come morning.\d%K%P
「但是风稍微减弱一点了吧？\n到早上台风就会通过的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMhm.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
It's almost been an hour since we got stuck in this\nposition.%K%P
我们紧抱在一起，差不多已经有一个小时了。%K%P
For the first dozen or so minutes, Mitoko didn't even\ntalk, and instead pressed against me like a baby seeking\nwarmth. But now, she was finally getting somewhat\nresponsive.%K%P
一开始美都子几乎都没有说话，\n只是紧抱着我而安心了下来。\n随着时间推移，她逐渐对我产生了反应。%K%P
Not to say she was back to her usual tone of complaints\nand lectures. All she would answer me with were quiet\nmurmurs that could have meant almost anything.%K%P
不过，她所说的并不是往常那些对我的责备或者是多管闲事，\n而净是那些既是肯定又是否定的『嗯』。%K%P
As for me, I was kind of starting to get worried my body\nmight accidentally react in a way that would be\ninappropriate for a guardian.%K%P
对我来说，\n本来只是因为保护欲而抱住了她，\n这个时候在生理上让我有一点辛苦了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, Mitoko, don't you think...\d%K%P
「呐，美都子，差不多该…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!!\d%K%P
「～～～！」%K%P
It seemed as though she had sensed my intentions, and\ninstead of releasing me, put strength back into her grip.%K%P
大概是敏感地察觉到了我那不怎么纯洁的态度，\n美都子手腕上加的力量，\n一下子变强了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOkay, I'm sorry... Don't worry, I won't let you go.\d%K%P
