%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMhm.\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
Once again, all I received was an ambiguous \dmhm.\d%K%P
然后，又是包含了肯定与否定两种态度的『嗯』。%K%P
I could picture her getting all defensive with something\nalong the lines of \dI never asked you to do anything of\nthe sort, okay?! You did it all yourself!\d tomorrow.%K%P
肯定到了明天，她就会说出『我才没有拜托过你那种事！\n不是失业先生擅自那么做的吗！』这种话吧。%K%P
Or rather, I hope she will, or else I won't know how to\nreact.%K%P
不如说，要是她不这么说的话我会很为难的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Mitoko.\d%K%P
「…美都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMhm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
In that closed-off room, where only our breath did\nanything to shift the air, I...%K%P
在只有两个人的吐息运转着空气流动的房间中…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTo tell you the truth, I have something to apologize to\nyou for.\d%K%P
