%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
I decided to unveil the truth myself, as Mitoko,\nregardless of how much time had passed, never really\nstarted questioning the logic of me being here.%K%P
不管怎么说，尽管美都子什么都没有问，\n但今晚出现在这里的我，\n早就决定要主动袒露真相。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI ran into some trouble at the company, and considering\nwhat happened last time, I couldn't bring myself to tell\nyou.\d%K%P
「那个，公司里又发生了一些事…\n还有一些之前的事，所以没法和美都子说」%K%P
I couldn't allow myself to succumb to this fleeting sense\nof happiness. After all, her tears tonight were mostly\ncaused by me.%K%P
因为我觉得，不能光沉浸在这样的幸福里。\n因为我知道，她是因为我的谎言才会哭泣。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut a certain person told me that using a mother as an\nexcuse is the worst possible thing I could pick in regards\nto you.\d%K%P
「但是，有个人告诉了我。\n『去见母亲了』这种谎言，\n对美都子来说，是最差劲的谎言」%K%P
