She finally started talking properly, and those were the\nfirst words to escape her mouth. It moved me to witness\nher anger...%K%P
好不容易终于可以正常地说话了，\n可是最开始说出的，是如此过分勉强自己的话语…%K%P
An anger so right, an anger so justified... and an anger\nso profoundly sad.%K%P
这是多么正当，多么正义，\n而且…多么悲伤，多么愤怒啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut I'm all right now... You came here, after all. You're\ndoing pretty well as Mom's substitute.\d%K%P
