%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
She tapped me lightly on the cheek, as if caressing it.%K%P
然后，仿佛要抱住我的脸颊似的，她拍了起来。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOw...!\d%K%P
「痛…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...What's wrong?\d%K%P
