After a completely painless slap, it was not the punishee,\nbut the punisher, who let out a small yelp.%K%P
完全不痛的两面耳光之后，\n发出小小悲啼声的，却是给予处罚的那一边。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm... I kinda hit it with a hammer earlier.\d%K%P
