I couldn't see that well in the darkness, but her finger\nseemed swollen, with blood at the sides.%K%P
虽然黑暗中看得不是很清楚，\n但还是可以看出美都子左手食指有些肿了，\n而且血也渗了出来。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry. I didn't notice.\d%K%P
