She started to talk properly, but it seemed like the spell\nhad yet to break.%K%P
虽说现在口齿变得伶俐起来了，\n但撒娇的魔法似乎还没有解除。%K%P
Her left hand remained in mine, but her right coiled\naround my back, putting me into a lock again.%K%P
握着的左手还保持着原样，\n只有右手绕过我的后背，又一次紧紧地拥了过来。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAll you've got to do is lick it a little to heal a wound\nthat small. Mom said so.\d%K%P
