%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-Mitoko...?\d%K%P
「美、美都子…」%K%P
Her finger extended towards my face like it was the most\nnatural thing in the world.%K%P
美都子的左手食指，\n若无其事地伸向我的脸…%K%P
It pressed against my lips.%K%P
就这样，安静地碰触到了我的嘴唇。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-M-Mhitokho?!\d%K%P
「美、美、美…美都子？」%K%P
How was I supposed to interpret this?%K%P
这…要作何解释？%K%P
No, there was probably only one interpretation. I just\ndidn't know whether or not I was supposed to accept it.%K%P
不，硬要解释的话也只有一种，\n只是我究竟能不能接受这种解释呢…%K%P
