%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNhm...\d%K%P
「嗯…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh... A-Ah...\d%K%P
「啊…啊啊…」%K%P
I licked the bloody area around her nail to melt the\ncongealed blood, and sucked it in.%K%P
我吸吮着被唾液溶解的鲜血，\n舌尖在滑溜溜的指尖上轻轻回转。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMhm... Tsk... Mmm...\d%K%P
