It was probably an action I would've normally hesitated to\ncarry out.%K%P
本来的话，这也许是让我不得不踌躇一番的行为。%K%P
But in that moment, we were literally licking each other's\nwounds, and it felt like the most natural thing in the\nworld.%K%P
但是这个时候的我们，\n就如同这个行为是理所应当一般，\n按照字面上的意思舔着伤口。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMmm... Tsk... Phew... There. I think that's enough.\d%K%P
