About three hours had passed since we ended up like this.%K%P
我们之间的紧拥，差不多已经有了三个小时。%K%P
The pitch black sky had grown somewhat lighter, and the\nstorm that had previously been raging as if the end was\nnigh had begun to lose its vigor.%K%P
漆黑的天空，已经稍稍明亮了起来；\n凶猛的暴风雨，也渐渐收起了自己的獠牙。%K%P
Although we had calmed down, we barely exchanged a word,\nand simply spent that time in idle silence.%K%P
在此期间，我们又一次陷入了沉默，\n恢复了冷静，等待着暴风雨的消散。%K%P
