On the very day that I literally became Mr. Laid-off...%K%P
我变成真正的『失业先生』这一天…%K%P
...Mitoko stopped calling me by that name.%K%P
美都子，却不再称呼我为『失业先生』了。%K%P
I think it took about ten times longer than it should\nhave, but at the same time, I felt it very fitting for us.%K%P
虽然非常害羞，\n但是这样的情况，要说是很像我们风格的话，或许的确如此吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnyway, I think I'll once again be spending most of my\ntime in this room for the time being.\d%K%P
「就是这样…\n从明天开始，我又要暂时在这间公寓里赋闲了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dFine by me. They say men who can put their family before\ntheir job are a rare breed nowadays.\d%K%P
「挺好的嘛。\n现在啊，不是说比起工作更重视家庭的男人\n更有价值的吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou think we're... a family?\d%K%P
「家庭…吗，我们」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, um... why... wouldn't we be?\d%K%P
「不是挺…好的吗？\n这样的话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see... Fair enough, then.\d%K%P
「是吗…挺好的」%K%P
Mother, daughter, or...%K%P
该算是妈妈呢，还是女儿呢，亦或是…%K%P
Putting that aside, this was the day Mitoko finally\nacknowledged me.%K%P
但是不管怎样，美都子就这样\n可喜可贺地全面地认同了我的介入。%K%P
And...%K%P
接下来…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dUm, Osamu.\d%K%P
「呐，理君」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat?\d%K%P
「怎么了？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI want to continue my education.\d%K%P
「我啊，想要升学呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
The day I lost my job...%K%P
我第三次失去工作的这一天…%K%P
The day I'd lost every last piece of financial support...%K%P
对我来说，第三次失去了所有经济后盾的这一天。%K%P
On that day, of all days... or perhaps precisely because\nit was a day like that, Mitoko finally chose to claim her\nlegitimate right as a child.%K%P
在这样的时候…不，正是因为在这样的时候，\n美都子才终于开始要求作为孩子的权利了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou think I shouldn't?\d%K%P
「不行、吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThere's no way I would.\d%K%P
「不可能不行吧…」%K%P
It was something I'd been hoping to hear for months. There\nwas no way I could have any qualms with her decision.%K%P
这可是一直以来，我所梦寐以求的事情。\n完全没有不同意的理由。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI can keep going like this. Knowing that I'm earning\nmoney to fund your education will give me the strength I\nneed to go on.\d%K%P
「毕竟，我还要再努力。\n为美都子筹集学费，\n这个理由又让我有了动力」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIn that case, I'll do my best just the same -- to be a\nburden on you.\d%K%P
「那，我也要努力。\n努力成为，理君的重担」%K%P
My feelings. My self-worth. My pride.%K%P
我的感情，我的矜持，我的自尊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo you can do your best from tomorrow... For me as well.\d%K%P
「为了让理君，明天也能重新打起精神努力；\n为了让理君，为了我而振作精神努力」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank you. ...As long as you need me, I won't fall\napart.\d%K%P
「谢谢…\n如果是被你拜托的话，我绝对不会再失败了」%K%P
In response to my petty, superfluous, and utterly useless\naspirations, Mitoko -- at long last -- began to act a\nlittle more understanding.%K%P
面对如此简单的、小气的、派不上任何用场的、只不过是自己的任性，\n美都子终于表现出了理解的样子。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm going to rely on you. To believe in you. So... I'm\ngoing to have you spoil me from now on.\d%K%P
「肯定会依靠你的。\n肯定会相信你的。\n…所以，就请让我撒娇吧？」%K%P
